{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y压缩了部分人物动机和因果铺垫，尤其S07删去了“早知道这样，自己还会走吗”的反问，S13也弱化了“即使一直没有，也愿意好好过下去”的条件意味，叙事落点不如X完整。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的重点词加亮、感受按音乐段落出现，让观众更容易在短时间里抓住每段的情绪转折，不必同时处理一大堆静态短词；而且音乐描写更具体，能感受到情绪如何从声音中发生。X的优势是人物心理的因果交代更充分，前后选择的逻辑也更完整，尤其能让人理解他为什么既怀念亲近又不愿回去。整体我选Y，因为实际观看时，扫读效率、段落重点和感受细腻度带来的收益更明显，但它确实牺牲了一部分叙事解释的完整性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "228d5de9-1437-4589-b846-97af90cc765b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T232031470724Z", "elapsed_seconds": 56.25, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:21:27.728716+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "264763317782b39c50d4e8bef9a6096f661fc28f31f6e914dd78216b8b0bb33a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222